2026-04-25 11:07:09,937 - INFO - OpenAI API response: I propose fine-tuning a pretrained ResNet18 on the binary task of malignant vs non-malignant (combining benign and non-neoplastic) using group‐reweighted sampling based on skin tone frequencies to mitigate bias. We will perform 5-fold stratified cross‐validation computing AUROC per fold to assess overall performance and fairness. After CV we’ll save the final model and provide a `predict()` function that takes a folder of new images and returns malignancy probabilities. The evaluation metric is the mean AUROC across folds. 

